Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted); not submitted upstream.
Open the database with every Berkeley DB from 4 on, not only 4.x.
With db5 or db18 sgDbInit() compiled no open call at all, so the
database handle was used unopened. EmberBSD keeps one Berkeley DB,
db18, which has the same DB->open signature as 4.x.

